{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_096_blip-title\">BLIP</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">区别于纯双塔，BLIP 用共享 MED 同时承担对齐、跨注意力匹配和因果生成，并把 captioner-filter 作为数据循环的一部分。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Unifies vision–language understanding and generation via a Multimodal Mixture of Encoder–Decoder (MED) coupled with a CapFilt data bootstrapping loop.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图像、原始网页描述及由 captioner 生成的合成描述</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Image + noisy web caption + synthetically generated and filtered captions</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图文检索/匹配表示和自回归图像描述</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Unimodal embeddings (ITC), cross-modal matching scores (ITM), and autoregressive captions (LM)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v162/li22n.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_096_blip')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_096_blip')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"BLIP original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/4da2fadb9fb85d4a0074.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_096_blip', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_096_blip\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_096_blip')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_096_blip', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_096_blip\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">噪声图文对</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">原始网页配对是训练语料起点</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests image + noisy web caption + synthetically generated and filtered captions and prepares initial tensor representations (noise).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"原始网页配对是训练语料起点\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests image + noisy web caption + synthetically generated and filtered captions and prepares initial tensor representations (noise).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"噪声图文对\" data-node-name-en=\"noise\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_096_blip', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">噪声图文对</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">原始网页配对是训练语料起点</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests image + noisy web caption + synthetically generated and filtered captions and prepares initial tensor representations (noise).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"captioner 生成补充描述，filter 剔除与图像不一致的原始或合成文本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes CapFilt to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"CapFilt\" data-node-name-en=\"CapFilt\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_096_blip', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CapFilt</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">captioner 生成补充描述，filter 剔除与图像不一致的原始或合成文本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes CapFilt to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"输出视觉 token，供三种文本模式共享\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs ViT encoder within the core multimodal encoder decoder capfilt computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"ViT 图像 encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"ViT encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_096_blip', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">ViT 图像 encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">ViT encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输出视觉 token，供三种文本模式共享</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs ViT encoder within the core multimodal encoder decoder capfilt computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"与图像全局表示计算 image-text contrastive 目标\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Unimodal text encoder within the core multimodal encoder decoder capfilt computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Unimodal text encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Unimodal text encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_096_blip', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Unimodal text encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">与图像全局表示计算 image-text contrastive 目标</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Unimodal text encoder within the core multimodal encoder decoder capfilt computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"双向自注意力加视觉 cross-attention，执行 image-text matching\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Image-grounded text encoder within the core multimodal encoder decoder capfilt computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Image-grounded text encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Image-grounded text encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_096_blip', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Image-grounded text encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">双向自注意力加视觉 cross-attention，执行 image-text matching</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Image-grounded text encoder within the core multimodal encoder decoder capfilt computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"因果自注意力加视觉 cross-attention，自回归生成描述\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Image-grounded text decoder within the core multimodal encoder decoder capfilt computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Image-grounded text decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Image-grounded text decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_096_blip', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Image-grounded text decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">因果自注意力加视觉 cross-attention，自回归生成描述</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Image-grounded text decoder within the core multimodal encoder decoder capfilt computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对齐、细粒度匹配与语言建模联合训练\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies ITC + ITM + LM to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"ITC + ITM + LM\" data-node-name-en=\"ITC + ITM + LM\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_096_blip', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>ITC + ITM + LM</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对齐、细粒度匹配与语言建模联合训练</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies ITC + ITM + LM to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"统一支持检索、匹配、问答适配和 caption\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces unimodal embeddings (itc), cross-modal matching scores (itm), and autoregressive captions (lm) via output.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"理解与生成输出\" data-node-name-en=\"output\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_096_blip', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">理解与生成输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">统一支持检索、匹配、问答适配和 caption</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces unimodal embeddings (itc), cross-modal matching scores (itm), and autoregressive captions (lm) via output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"BLIP Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · CapFilt 清洗后的三目标联合预训练</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Joint ITC + ITM + LM Pretraining with Synthetic Captioner–Filter Bootstrapping</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"BLIP：核心公式 · CapFilt 清洗后的三目标联合预训练\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"96\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"21.339504pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.011212 268.029457 21.339504\" width=\"268.029457pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M6.312567-7.195929H6.014804C5.935401-6.947794 5.647564-6.729435 4.664947-6.729435C3.722032-6.729435 3.404419-7.166153 2.49128-7.166153C.982617-7.166153 .555824-6.719509 .297763-6.163686H.595525C.674929-6.411821 1.032244-6.620255 2.01486-6.620255C2.94785-6.620255 3.275389-6.183537 4.188527-6.183537C5.697191-6.183537 6.054506-6.640106 6.312567-7.195929Z\" id=\"m096_g4-101\"></path><path d=\"M12.317446 10.937813H