></use><use x=\"157.677801\" xlink:href=\"#m096_g20-126\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"156.706458\" xlink:href=\"#m096_g13-72\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"161.564743\" xlink:href=\"#m096_g10-67\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"168.174136\" xlink:href=\"#m096_g7-106\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"174.702347\" xlink:href=\"#m096_g20-126\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"173.731005\" xlink:href=\"#m096_g13-72\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"178.705651\" xlink:href=\"#m096_g10-159\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"183.84747\" xlink:href=\"#m096_g10-67\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"187.291019\" xlink:href=\"#m096_g13-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"191.551653\" xlink:href=\"#m096_g13-71\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"196.458236\" xlink:href=\"#m096_g7-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">网页图文噪声大，理解与生成模型往往分开训练</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Pure dual encoders (CLIP) cannot generate free text, while noisy web captions degrade generative language modeling.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以统一 encoder-decoder 架构结合图文对比、匹配和生成目标</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Share weights across a multimodal encoder–decoder trained jointly on contrastive, matching, and generative objectives while bootstrapping clean captions.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用 captioner-filter 构造更干净合成描述并统一多任务预训练</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Weight-shared MED architecture + CapFilt (a captioner generates synthetic descriptions while a filter removes noisy image–text pairs).</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">为医学报告生成、问答与跨模态检索提供通用范式</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Provides a versatile blueprint for joint radiology report retrieval, image-report matching verification, and caption generation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">VLM 数据清洗与多目标训练仍关键；临床事实性需独立约束</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Data bootstrapping remains highly relevant; in medicine, synthetic captions must be audited against hallucinated clinical findings.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">同一 MED 文本骨架切换单模态编码、图像条件编码和图像条件解码三种模式。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">ITC 负责全局对齐，ITM 负责细粒度判别，LM 负责开放式生成。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">CapFilt 让模型反过来生成并筛选训练描述，改善网络语料质量。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Share weights across a multimodal encoder–decoder trained jointly on contrastive, matching, and generative objectives while bootstrapping clean captions.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Weight-shared MED architecture + CapFilt (a captioner generates synthetic descriptions while a filter removes noisy image–text pairs).</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Joint ITC + ITM + LM Pretraining with Synthetic Captioner–Filter Bootstrapping.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可将报告生成、影像检索与医学视觉问答置于一套预训练接口。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">自动生成或过滤的医学描述可能遗漏阴性发现和不确定措辞，必须保留来源与人工抽检。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Provides a versatile blueprint for joint radiology report retrieval, image-report matching verification, and caption generation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Data bootstrapping remains highly relevant; in medicine, synthetic captions must be audited against hallucinated clinical findings.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v162/li22n.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>BLIP: Bootstrapping Language-Image Pre-training for Unified Vision-Language Understanding and Generation</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/salesforce/BLIP\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
